  "description": {
    "html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Designed in premium Storm Nylon fabric, this bottle green embroidered kurta set combines modern elegance with traditional styling. The mandarin-collar kurta is beautifully detailed with embroidery and paired with matching palazzo pants for enhanced comfort and contemporary appeal. An excellent choice for festive celebrations, receptions, and cultural events.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Key Features</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Premium Storm Nylon fabric</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Elegant embroidered detailing</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Mandarin collar for a refined finish</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Full sleeves with a comfortable fit</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Matching palazzo pants included</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Lightweight and breathable construction</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Perfect for festive occasions, receptions, and celebrations</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Styling Tips</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Pair with embroidered mojaris for a regal finish.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Accessorize with a statement watch.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Layer with a contrasting stole for wedding functions.</div>",
